<topic xml:id="sle15-packages-lifecycle-java"
 role="concept" xml:lang="en"
 xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" version="5.2"
 xmlns:its="http://www.w3.org/2005/11/its"
 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
 xmlns:trans="http://docbook.org/ns/transclusion">
  <info>
    <title>Java lifecycle support</title>
    <meta name="maintainer" content="lkucharczyk@suse.com" its:translate="no"/>
  </info>
  <para>Java is not supported in Reactive LTSS and Extreme LTSS offerings. IBM Java 8 is available again in the Legacy Module of &suselinux; 15 SP7. &suse; does not support IBM Java. To get support, you must have a support contract with IBM.</para>
  <table xml:id="table-sle15-java-lifecycle" frame="all">
    <title>Java lifecycle support on &suselinux; 15</title>
    <tgroup cols="5">
      <colspec colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
      <colspec colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
      <colspec colname="c3" colwidth="1.5*"/>
      <colspec colname="c4" colwidth="1.5*"/>
      <colspec colname="c5" colwidth="3*"/>
      <thead>
        <row>
          <entry>Name (Package)</entry>
          <entry>Version</entry>
          <entry>Module availability</entry>
          <entry>Support end</entry>
          <entry>Note</entry>
        </row>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <row>
          <entry>IBM Java (<literal>java-1_8_0-ibm</literal>)</entry>
          <entry>1.8.0</entry>
          <entry>SP0–SP7 (Legacy Module)</entry>
          <entry>December 2030</entry>
          <entry>&suse; gives no support. IBM makes free public updates available until 2030.</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
          <entry>OpenJDK (<literal>java-1_8_0-openjdk</literal>)</entry>
          <entry>1.8.0</entry>
          <entry>SP0–SP7 (Legacy Module)</entry>
          <entry>December 2026</entry>
          <entry>Aligned with &suselinux; 15 SP4 LTSS end.</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
          <entry>OpenJDK (<literal>java-11-openjdk</literal>)</entry>
          <entry>11</entry>
          <entry>SP1–SP5 (Basesystem), SP6–SP7 (Legacy)</entry>
          <entry>December 2027</entry>
          <entry>Aligned with &suselinux; 15 SP5 LTSS end.</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
          <entry>OpenJDK (<literal>java-17-openjdk</literal>)</entry>
          <entry>17</entry>
          <entry>SP4–SP5 (Basesystem), SP6–SP7 (Legacy)</entry>
          <entry>December 2027</entry>
          <entry>Aligned with &suselinux; 15 SP5 LTSS end.</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
          <entry>OpenJDK (<literal>java-21-openjdk</literal>)</entry>
          <entry>21</entry>
          <entry>SP6–SP7 (Basesystem)</entry>
          <entry>July 2034</entry>
          <entry>Aligned with &suselinux; 15 SP7 LTSS end.</entry>
        </row>
        <row>
          <entry>OpenJDK (<literal>java-25-openjdk</literal>)</entry>
          <entry>25</entry>
          <entry>SP7 (Basesystem)</entry>
          <entry>October 2033</entry>
          <entry>Aligned with the OpenJDK 25 support end in &suselinux; 16.</entry>
        </row>
      </tbody>
    </tgroup>
  </table>
</topic>
